your archives.  My own university is now (finally) interested in 
creating a campus-wide electronic privacy policy.

If any of you could direct me to a particularly excellent policy or 
even a relatively good one, I would be appreciative.  My institution 
is a small state-supported technical university with open computer 
access to all students at any level.  All faculty members also have 
complete access to all computing facilities.  All dorm rooms are 
