To my eye, there would seem to be little justification for varying standards
based on ethnicity.  It seems reasonable to apply different standards on
the basis of educational disadvantage--after all, a gpa of x for a
disadvantaged student may indicate far more potential than a gpa of x
would indicate for a student who has been provided with all the best.

